<title>ROMANIA: SOCCER-F.C. NATIONAL BEAT 2-0 ODESSA.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-F.C. NATIONAL BEAT 2-0 ODESSA.</headline>
<dateline>BUCHAREST 1996-09-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>F.C. National Bucharest (Romania) beat 2-0 (halftime 0-0) Cernomoret Odessa (Ukraine) in their first round, second leg match of UEFA Cup on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>F.C. National Bucharest - Danut Moisescu 48th, Radu Niculescu 57th</p>
<p>Attendance: 7,000</p>
<p>F.C. National won 2-0 on aggregate.</p>
</text>
